            <div xml:id="m-1a52a52b-6274-44f3-879f-1435f5cf4fde">
              <lg xml:id="m-63cc4cd1-2a7f-454c-b621-6525007fc528">
                <l xml:id="m-4b9f78dc-3372-4d05-b792-c145e7bccb4f" facs="#m-d4cd2874-fd4c-42a2-a491-82ad302ce4d2" label="ambiguous">1120</l><l xml:id="m-5aba1ac6-5531-4167-90d4-c9f855b7fff2" facs="#m-46d3ab86-96c0-46c1-9796-b64eb6667044" label="text-like">Common of Apostles and Evangelists. P. T.</l><l xml:id="m-5d6eea12-a9e3-40bf-8233-7e1bd2cb9c88" facs="#m-2452655d-9063-4080-81e5-5f868cfccde3" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-9fdf4d48-2e88-491c-b72e-5846f74f4cb1" facs="#m-0be2ef73-e5c9-4787-8590-4e332bc411b3" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-4e63bc69-8160-41c0-92bd-04ff544ff975" facs="#m-1a128dc0-1e65-4181-abb4-6593b87571a1" label="lyrics-like">AAetí-ti-a sempi-térna super cápi-ta e-órum:</l><l xml:id="m-7eb52591-696f-436d-bacb-9fa35e4727fc" facs="#m-b2076e0c-e472-4b2f-8e4d-977be125e68b" label="lyrics-like">Alle-lú-ia. alle-lú-ia. V. Gáudi-um et exsulta-ti-ónem</l><l xml:id="m-d523ab16-d35b-4a04-be8f-a1151e97bd6e" facs="#m-1e7c230b-f8a2-4694-8bd1-8131c56e1c8e" label="lyrics-like">obtinébunt. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-e8d47ed8-ab42-4477-bf9d-3497cd0f6477" facs="#m-af0384b4-6997-426e-880d-33b028bb9903" label="lyrics-like">V. Pretiósa in conspéctu Dómini, alleluia.</l><l xml:id="m-1a620725-12e9-432f-b14a-34e8affecf40" facs="#m-2410a51f-548b-44a1-ae4a-ea9e91337156" label="lyrics-like">B. Mors Sanctórum éjus, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-b44a8d2d-912f-4623-85a5-eabf2e80d847" facs="#m-ae93f8f0-0cf1-40e3-83b1-df4ef903cf03" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-b2c889c1-be7f-4ddf-85ba-3bc066b6b9ee" facs="#m-39e06749-8043-453a-8fe3-44a004033b31" label="lyrics-like">Psalms at first Vespers. 1. Dixit Dóminus. 8. G. p. 133. — 2. Confi¬</l><l xml:id="m-128026b8-6a38-46c2-9925-2b493cec8940" facs="#m-9342acc7-60e4-4baa-9510-baeadb05b025" label="lyrics-like">tébor. 7. a. D. 139. — 3. Beátus vir. 2. D. p. 141. — 4. Laudáte púeri.</l><l xml:id="m-8681f21b-dac5-4559-953b-c3f861c4266a" facs="#m-593eb8fa-ca94-4b65-b992-b63371bfe27d" label="lyrics-like">8. G. D. 152. — 5. Laudáte Dóminum. 2. D. p. 166.</l><l xml:id="m-ad44a17d-d4d4-49f2-aec3-a9e38366581e" facs="#m-51d4e249-3061-4941-8baf-0e73642da57c" label="lyrics-like">Psalms at second Vespers 1. Dixit Dóminus. 8. G. p. 133. — 2. Laudáte</l><l xml:id="m-21889666-5bfb-42c7-a9c2-696f301a132a" facs="#m-ba7a8a79-eb5c-4485-aca8-dbc39a83a438" label="lyrics-like">púeri. 7. a. D. 151. — 3. Crédidi. 2. D. p. 162. — 4. In converténdo.</l><l xml:id="m-cb5ec244-18fc-405b-aa52-1ac12f12c30e" facs="#m-9fbb910f-00f0-4571-a4fb-295990010729" label="lyrics-like">8. G*. p. 175. — 5. Dómine probásti me. 2. D. p. 186.</l><l xml:id="m-a62a5056-b25c-4baa-88d5-d0f5dad714b0" facs="#m-851578f9-183e-4d19-983a-dfe43c72cc46" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-32d0e75f-9d11-4d30-a2ed-53bee12ad1cd" facs="#m-74b63e63-64eb-4634-8470-e261819ced4f" label="ambiguous">8.6</l><l xml:id="m-52b6036e-e36c-4727-9a5c-0bfbdad1a173" facs="#m-bb611d96-8d46-4bb9-bf14-a68f5ad1b607" label="lyrics-like">Ancti tú-i“Dómine florébunt sic-ut lí-li-um, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-39125352-8e76-453c-a428-cfb68ed769d8" facs="#m-b4c76dc1-6932-4443-8958-cb85a8c6ee54" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia: et sic-ut ódor bálsami</l><l xml:id="m-6fc58873-01ee-4d5e-8236-39d33d424064" facs="#m-a7224a0e-f48a-4acd-b733-a8911de4cccf" label="lyrics-like">é-runt ante te, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-52450df0-670f-4826-bc88-b3a17bf67926" facs="#m-5d50be52-d36e-4d67-871b-bdb28c23dc13" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-70e0efef-ddd9-43d7-b3c7-dac9bde2c012" facs="#m-7c31f19c-8545-4a61-97e6-c30891970979" label="ambiguous">7.a</l><l xml:id="m-2ca49a2e-21c4-47f2-8452-a4f358d68b71" facs="#m-f573ef98-682b-4844-9854-d69fb4f391ca" label="lyrics-like">Ncaeléstibus régnis “San¬</l><l xml:id="m-4b850887-6aca-48ad-a8be-f34084ae4511" facs="#m-d7f1d8ef-210e-4416-8440-ad222b2dc085" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-53903a68-074c-415c-8b25-fdb925082fa1" facs="#m-388a4ef6-1d88-4b50-9c92-29fb8f2ede66" label="lyrics-like">ctórum habi-tá-ti-o est, alle-lú-ia: et in actérnum réqui-es</l><l xml:id="m-75680ec4-f664-48cd-81e1-9cf58074b6fc" facs="#m-7a6641ef-f20e-4289-afc6-198d71199b3f" label="ambiguous">3. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-7465021e-e925-4d10-9ccf-7ff6f8a7439c" facs="#m-81b4d07e-95e0-4caf-ac8c-c15adf1756b6" label="ambiguous">2.D</l><l xml:id="m-5207ba4b-ea68-4a53-ae76-32c1e632de83" facs="#m-450998eb-3e96-4533-a33b-595ac993df2b" label="ambiguous">–</l><l xml:id="m-13b5ab8e-4b5f-4d8a-a327-d4a62707cc10" facs="#m-21744bc3-e86a-4c70-af29-65dea1d0e9a3" label="ambiguous">—</l><l xml:id="m-33eb4ae6-18c7-4d14-9df7-5299e5d7644f" facs="#m-6903d47c-2276-43cc-bbcb-2a556d4aa38e" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-eaaba48a-1e82-4e14-bfb6-150b3b634c94" facs="#m-9f71043d-8d95-4985-a193-7dcddc7774e2" label="lyrics-like">e-ó-rum, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-e3a45341-489a-441e-9eeb-9d3f8f1b011e" facs="#m-57c7f546-8fb6-4e8c-82aa-ba95624e8dae" label="ambiguous">N ve-la¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ee97f91-c9d2-49ae-8f2e-f3e7e67fcbb8" facs="#m-abac3a92-f09f-4760-a0aa-28b6026fb443" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l></lg>
